WEBVTT

00:00:58.663 --> 00:01:01.297
and precision reflexes
required to play them well.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.530
To me, they were equally admirable

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:06.830
to anything taking place in stadia
around the world.

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.097
And I still feel that way.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.397
Today, I still love video games,

00:01:11.397 --> 00:01:13.863
I founded successful
companies in the space

00:01:13.897 --> 00:01:16.363
and I've even written a book
about the industry.

00:01:16.397 --> 00:01:18.030
But most importantly,

00:01:18.063 --> 00:01:20.230
I've discovered I'm not alone,

00:01:20.263 --> 00:01:22.730
because as I've grown up, so has gaming.

00:01:23.197 --> 00:01:25.597
And today, millions of players
around the world

00:01:25.597 --> 00:01:28.063
need to compete in gaming centers

00:01:28.097 --> 00:01:29.930
like this helix,

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:31.430
and large gaming tournaments,